OL,3,AG7 to release up to 100 million barrels
OL,4,Aof diesel and crude oil in bid to stop
OL,5,Asoaring prices
OL,6,
OL,7,FAverage UK diesel prices have hit a
OL,8,Frecord high, according to motoring
OL,9,Fgroup the RAC, reaching #2 a litre for
OL,10,Fthe first time
OL,12,FHowever, UK Transport Minister Keir
OL,13,FMather says Britain's supply of diesel
OL,14,Fis "robust" and "resilient" and the
OL,15,Fcountry has a wide range of sources
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/38
