OL,3,AChaos, coffins and 'Claudiapatra' steal
OL,4,Athe show in Celebrity Traitors
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpoiler warning: This article reveals
OL,7,Fdetails from the first episode of The
OL,8,FCelebrity Traitors, series two.
OL,10,FOne person in particular may have
OL,11,Fdominated much of this opening episode,
OL,12,Fbut Claudia Winkleman's gothic arrival
OL,13,Fstill caused a stir.
OL,15,FCarried aloft by druids in a closed
OL,16,Fcoffin, the show's host arrived in a
OL,17,Fchurch, to greet 21 anxious-looking
OL,18,Fcelebrities.
OL,20,F"That was quite the nap," she said as
OL,21,Fshe emerged.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/38
