OL,3,AWoman in Cornell University rape case
OL,4,Awas 'failed at every turn', New York
OL,5,Agovernor says
OL,6,
OL,7,FNew York Governor Kathy Hochul has said
OL,8,Fthe woman at the centre of the Cornell
OL,9,FUniversity rape case was "failed" at
OL,10,F"every turn"
OL,12,FThe case was reopened after the woman
OL,13,Ffiled a civil lawsuit last month,
OL,14,Falleging she was drugged and raped by
OL,15,Fseven men at a fraternity house in 2024
OL,17,FGiving an update earlier, Hochul said
OL,18,Fshe was "deeply disturbed" by the
OL,19,Fhandling of the case and that she won't
OL,20,Fallow it "to be swept under the rug" -
OL,21,Fhere's what else we heard
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
