OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AWoman in Cornell University rape case
OL,4,Awas 'failed at every turn', New York
OL,5,Agovernor says
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe also announced plans to change
OL,8,Fstate law around consent, saying: "If
OL,9,Fsomeone is too intoxicated to consent
OL,10,Fit should not matter if they chose to
OL,11,Fuse drugs or alcohol"
OL,13,FOn Thursday, Hochul appointed New York
OL,14,FAttorney General Letitia James as
OL,15,Fspecial prosecutor for the case, saying
OL,16,Fshe had "lost faith" in the local
OL,17,Fprosecutor's ability to oversee the
OL,18,Finvestigation
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/38
